# Fortune Smart Institute Azure Deployment

## Technologies
- Azure App Service
- ARM Template
- HTML/CSS
- Azure CLI

## Deployment Workflow
1. Create Resource Group
2. Deploy ARM Template
3. Create Staging Slot
4. Zip Website
5. Deploy to Staging
6. Swap to Production

## URLs
Production:
https://fortune-smart-main.azurewebsites.net

Staging:
https://fortune-smart-main-staging.azurewebsites.net

